                <pb facs="0413" n="1463" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v11p2/pg1463"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On October 24, Ambassador Sardar Mohammed Naim discussed with Bruce the
                    Pushtunistan question and other issues in the light of the recent Soviet <hi
                        rendition="#italic">démarche</hi>. The memorandum of this conversation is
                    printed on <ref target="#pg1376">page 1376</ref>.</p>
                <p>On October 29, a conversation on similar subjects took place in New York between
                    the Secretary, Ambassador Naim, and Mohammed Kabir Ludin, Afghan Representative
                    at the United Nations. For the memorandum of this conversation, see <ref
                        target="#pg1378">page 1378</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
